/t_thumb/scz2vm.jpg"}, {"id": 1636691, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scz2vn.jpg"}, {"id": 1636692, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scz2vo.jpg"}, {"id": 1636688, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scz2vk.jpg"}, {"id": 1636686, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scz2vi.jpg"}], "slug": "cook-for-me-grandpa", "storyline": "\"Cook for Me Grandpa!\" is a heartwarming novel-cum-cooking simulation game in which you cook for your AI grandchildren.\n\nCollect over 100 ingredients and cooking skills, combine them as you like to create recipes, and share them with your grandchildren. After tasting your food, your grandchildren will respond to you with their impressions and scores. Sometimes strict, sometimes kind\u2014their reactions are just like those of a real family.\n\nWill your dish be one your grandchildren will remember?\n\nAim to be the proud grandfather you are, so head to the kitchen.", "summary": "Cook for your AI grandchildren in this heartwarming novel + cooking simulation. Combine over 100 ingredients and skills to create unique recipes. Your grandkids will react with feedback\u2014sometimes strict, sometimes kind. Can your cooking become a memory they cherish?", "themes": [{"id": 33, "name": "Sandbox"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/cook-for-me-grandpa", "videos": [{"id": 166261, "name": "Teaser", "video_id": "N7Gx4Gtpm2U", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=N7Gx4Gtpm2U", "title": "Cook for Me Grandpa! Teaser", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/N7Gx4Gtpm2U/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}